[[File:1920 - before the storm.jpg|thumb|right|260px|A painting by [[Jakub Różalski]] depicts an alternative history of the 1920s in ''[[Scythe (board game)|Scythe]]'', in which rural peasants must contend with giant mechanical walking tanks.]]
